{
  "name": "Accent group",
  "description": "A schema 7 Home Screen document where one layer asks for the accent group. A tinted Home Screen renders the widget in WidgetKit's accented mode: the tile's own ground goes, every layer keeps only how bright it was, and the system paints two groups in two related colours. `accentGroup` names which group a layer joins; it is optional and written only for the away-from-default `accent`, so the text and the shape here carry no key and resolve to the default group. The key only ever adds to the accent group, so a shape, an icon, a gauge, a chart or a timeline is accentable whether or not the document says so.",
